Local modifications (TargetCheck contributors, 2026-11-15)
-----------------------------------------------------------
These are local additions. They are not upstream GNU Wget changes and have
not been reviewed or approved upstream.

patches/0000-test-content-range-unit-tests.patch
  Test-only instrumentation for every variant: adds
  tests/content-range-cases.c (new file, GPL-3.0-or-later) and lets the
  upstream tests/unit-tests program run named parse_content_range cases.
patches/0003-local-reject-overflowing-range-length.patch
  Local guard, pending upstream review, that rejects the zero-start range
  ending at WGINT_MAX, whose length last_byte_pos - first_byte_pos + 1 the
  caller cannot represent. It does not cover the caller's later
  contlen + contrange sum (see README.md), so the complete variant is not a
  complete repair of caller-side overflow.

